==== hyperbricks yaml {!{fragment}} ====
fragment:
  - type: fragment
  - response:
      headers:
        HX-Trigger: statusUpdated
==== explainer ====
Sends an application event with HX-Trigger in HTMX 4. To run browser code after settling, use an explicit htmx:after:settle listener; this header does not preserve the removed HX-Trigger-After-Settle timing.
